      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "CONJUGATION: {仕上|しあ}がる is a godan verb. Te-form: {仕上|しあ}がって.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- きれいに{仕上|しあ}がる (to turn out beautifully)\n- うまく{仕上|しあ}がる (to turn out well)\n- {見事|みごと}に{仕上|しあ}がる (to turn out splendidly)\n\nThe transitive counterpart is {仕上|しあ}げる (to finish, to complete something). {仕上|しあ}がる is intransitive and focuses on the result — how the completed product turned out.",
